{"title":"The Collectively Drawn World","link":"https://kottke.org/26/11/the-collectively-drawn-world","date":1793640600000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793190565-dd4da3b2.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793190565-dd4da3b2.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793190565-dd4da3b2.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793083898-ea19ad9e.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793083898-ea19ad9e.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793083898-ea19ad9e.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793084146-f9152e21.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793084146-f9152e21.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1793084146-f9152e21.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><a href=\"https://www.habibicode.org/thedrawnmaps\">The Drawn Maps</a> are the borders of the countries, state, provinces, and other official territories collectively drawn by more than 300,000 people playing an online daily game called <a href=\"https://www.habibicode.org/borderline\">Borderline</a>. There’s <a href=\"https://www.habibicode.org/thedrawnworld\">a world map</a> as well as maps of <a href=\"https://www.habibicode.org/thedrawnusa\">the USA</a>, <a href=\"https://www.habibicode.org/thedrawncanada\">Canada</a>, <a href=\"https://www.habibicode.org/thedrawnitaly\">Italy</a>, and more. There are also <a href=\"https://www.habibicode.org/thedrawnmaps/timelapses\">timelapse versions of some of the maps</a>.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/infoviz\">infoviz</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/maps\">maps</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"687f779158893eda129984d367f3378191dfb74d08fa86449249dccb0ce20bd4","category":"Sites"}